---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Design">
  <main class="px-6 md:px-0">
    {/* Container */}
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      {/* Top spacing */}
      <div class="pt-24 md:pt-32"></div>

      {/* Heading */}
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-head leading-tight tracking-tight mb-10">
        Design
      </h1>

      <p class="leading-relaxed font-sans mb-6">I liek designe.</p>

      <p class="leading-relaxed font-sans mb-6">
        but for realsies, I've never intended on setting out on becoming a
        designer, but I ended up having to venture into this often during my
        expeditions in other fields like film or music or code.
      </p>

      <p class="leading-relaxed font-sans mb-6">
        So over the years, I've ended up making a variety of different little
        projects and stuff, and now I can't go back.
      </p>

      {/* Footer spacing */}
      <div class="h-24 md:h-32"></div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
